# Build context for `docker build -f cluster/deploy/docker/Dockerfile[.operator] .` (from
# the repository root). BuildKit reads this file automatically because it sits
# next to the Dockerfile. Allow-list: the root workspace (Cargo.toml +
# Cargo.lock, the root package's src/, crates/, cluster/, vendor/ and the
# bench/compare and bench/path-poc members, which cargo must be able to load). No tests/, docs/,
# other bench/ data or build outputs. (~10 MB context.)
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!crates
!cluster
!bench
bench/*
!bench/compare
!bench/path-poc
bench/path-poc/*
!bench/path-poc/Cargo.toml
!bench/path-poc/src
!vendor
**/target
**/target-*
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
**/*.mov
cluster/docs
cluster/deploy/helm
cluster/deploy/k8s
cluster/deploy/operator
cluster/scripts
